            "heading": "",
            "text": "Transferable skills are abilities that carry across jobs, such as communication, analysis, organising, teaching, customer handling and learning quickly, and the way to show them is to tie each skill to a specific example with a result, so the employer can see it working."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Employers look for evidence, so avoid claims you cannot support."
          }
        ]
